ctions — film 16\" aria-label=\"Play film — Ready To Go Productions — film 16\"><span>Play film</span></button></div></article><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview \"><img src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/517788204-451886c1ac8b58450e5b6d433f67374bc34f8b48f8abe0ae071ef743f52fd815-d_960?region=us\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Ready To Go Productions — film 17\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"127097693\" data-film-title=\"Ready To Go Productions — film 17\" aria-label=\"Play film — Ready To Go Productions — film 17\"><span>Play film</span></button></div></article></div></section><section class=\"gl-rtg-intro\"><div class=\"gl-landing-wrap\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">The company behind the work</p><h2>A steady hand.<br>A wider perspective.</h2><p>Ready To Go Productions is Frank Scudero’s established, active production company. Approximately 30 years directing live television inform the work: preparation, timing, anticipation and the ability to stay calm as events unfold.</p><p>That experience extends to interviews, television-style productions, special events, weddings and broader production projects. We start by understanding what you need to communicate, then talk through the right approach.</p></div></section><section class=\"gl-landing-wrap gl-rtg-services\"><h2>What we can create together.</h2><div><article><h3>Live &amp; special events</h3><p>Production shaped around the people, pace and purpose of the event.</p></article><article><h3>Interviews &amp; commercial projects</h3><p>Clear conversations and purposeful images for the message you want to share.</p></article><article><h3>Television-style production</h3><p>Live-production experience applied to the way a program comes together.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"gl-rtg-giolina\"><div class=\"gl-landing-wrap\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">A personal connection</p><h2>The experience GioLina grew from.</h2><p>GioLina Films was created from the experience behind Ready To Go Productions as a dedicated boutique wedding brand for cinematography and photography. Ready To Go continues the broader production work, with that same care behind the camera.</p><a class=\"gl-landing-text-link\" href=\"/\">Discover GioLina Films →</a></div></section><section class=\"gl-landing-inquiry\"><p class=\"gl-landing-kicker\">Are You Ready</p><h2>Tell us what you’re planning.</h2><a class=\"gl-landing-button\" href=\"mailto:info@giolina.co?subject=Ready%20To%20Go%20Productions%20inquiry\">Start a conversation</a><p><a href=\"mailto:info@giolina.co\">info@giolina.co</a> · <a href=\"tel:8663060308\">866-306-0308</a></p></section></article>",
